string\", \"description\": \"Filter entities by name or alias (case-insensitive).\"}, \"domain\": {\"anyOf\": [{\"type\": \"string\"}, {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}}], \"description\": \"Filter entities by domain (e.g. '⟦577⟧', 'sensor'). Accepts a single domain or a list.\"}, \"area\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Filter entities by area name or alias (case-insensitive).\"}}, \"additionalProperties\": ⟦576⟧}, \"description\": \"Provides real-time information about the CURRENT state, value, or mode of devices, sensors, entities, or areas. Use this tool for: 1. Answering questions about current conditions (e.g., 'Is the ⟦577⟧ on?'). 2. As the first step in conditional actions (e.g., 'If the weather is rainy, turn off sprinklers' requires checking the weather first). You may filter for devices by name, domain, and area, including combining those filters. Prefer filtering by domain when searching for multiple devices of the same type.\"}, {\"name\": \"intent__HassTurnOn\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"name\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"area\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"floor\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"domain\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}}, \"device_class\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"tv\", \"speaker\", \"receiver\", \"projector\", \"awning\", \"blind\", \"curtain\", \"damper\", \"door\", \"⟦545⟧\", \"gate\", \"shade\", \"shutter\", \"window\", \"identify\", \"restart\", \"update\", \"outlet\", \"switch\", \"water\", \"gas\"]}}}, \"additionalProperties\": ⟦576⟧}, \"description\": \"Turns on/⟦590⟧s/presses a device or entity. For ⟦587⟧s, this performs a '⟦587⟧' action. Use for requests like 'turn on', 'activate', 'enable', or '⟦587⟧'.\"}, {\"name\": \"intent__HassTurnOff\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"name\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"area\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"floor\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"d